  "bookId": "2CO",
  "reference": "2 Gorinto 4",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maghasta Guroorooda aba jeeda dahuundiga sigeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aba sareani, iinukwa geandeawi gadiyeeni aba baydeayda ASEETA, ghanyea meabealbeali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siheawi ng'asheega baspaseega, ea naweadinga ng'uyyeenya; ak geaheawi gideaba gajeesna milmilanda ghana eeyamujeena sea ng'asheanda ASEETA, geaghus aba ng'asheega huumeanda sirugu aba eeshpwara ak geaghwarji geat aba giliwas fughareemba sih aba madeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama deepa giijasteanya miy ea funyaat, ada abeeda geaghus ea funyaat aba heedeaba fugiga roodeadiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba sareani aseeteaba ng'eanyiini ninung' gang'oowiidi fughareenga fuga mandeawana masaweega, ak ghaweada deakta weeshinda giijasta miy mideawa giigheambiita Gristo, nea niny gawuurji sea ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba meerukuuni ng'asheega badahuukaasa aseasa geeruku gideaba Gristo Yesu Ng'utamiida, ea gideaba aseasa geewooschi soomjoogeagwa aba badayda Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea ASEETA gil dea ayi, “Nung'waada weeshinda ghoabwaay jeeda misaneeda,” nea niny ghoabwaay jeesinga gurooruunatkaasa ak ghoadaw weeshinda fughareeda giigheambiita ASEETA aba gheamamda Gristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi aseasa geendeawi gheaseeda aba jeeda haleanjeeda sigeeda, ak ghoahiimu gideaba Uri hawiin gwaleabu heeda ASEETA nea maleapna heedeanya aseasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geesawaneasa aba naweadinga sean, ak ea mwasuunya uurjeengaasa; iissa geehirbabanyi, ak ghanyea meanyeahani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geesawaneasa, ak ea meenung'useasa heeda; iissa geefuteeweasa ng'eanyi, ak ea meeshealani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "galeagasean geesareeni badahuukaasa miyeeda Yesu, ak abeeda geatahaach eaweega Yesu aba sasanuukaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba aseaseeni sindiin iissa geetaydaneasa eenuuseasa galeagasean aba badayda Yesu, ak abeeda geatahaach eaweega Yesu aba sasanuukaasa jea gameewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gagadiiy miyeeda aba sasanuukaasa, nea gagadiiy eaweega aba sasanuukeagwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu iinukwa geendeawi gurooroodida bea masaweegean geang'waar gideaba, “Ghaamwaschi, ak ghoah gideabalooli,” eara aseasa simwaschi, ak ghoah gisibalooli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea abeeda geanali gideaba siida ghayi adiidu Ng'utamiida was Yesu, gaygooduuneasa eara aseasa sea Yesu ak ghwayiineasa madeadaanyi sea agooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ng'asheega sean gaba badahuukeagwa nea gidahaadaata dagheerjeanduumeeda muuchi, ghoahaada badiischeesiinda aba heeda fuga saang'a, aba giigheambiita ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibinda aba masaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi majeabealbeala. Earapeadi iissa gawoosiidi sasanuukaasa, iidu gurooruunatkaasa iissa geeweeshiit giliwas eaweecha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba sawanadeedeanya sinyaschi gaba gheadi nuwaas ak gwasinneasa giigheambiita haw manda gichea eegala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba meeng'uli haleanjeeda sidaah geaghus haleanjeedida meadaahaan. Aba gideaba haleanjeeda sidaah ghang'ata, nea haleanjeedida meadaahaan gwandeawa eaweega mamuudeana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
